<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Scientific Games raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Scientific Games raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James Financial said it raised its recommendation on Scientific Games Holding Corp to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose one to 24 in midmorning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
